# title: Ctrl+F find bar — Chinese labels, n/m counter, Enter advances, Esc closes
# checklist: C1
# engines: cm native
# timeout: 150
open:$V\find.md
uclick:~alpha beta
key:ctrl+home
key:ctrl+f
ms:800
type:alpha
ms:900
shot:find
uia:C1.zh-find-field|查找@Edit
[cm] uia:C1.zh-next-button|下一个 (Enter)@Button
[cm] uia:C1.zh-case-button|区分大小写@Button
set:n1|UiaName '^\d+/\d+$'
expect:C1.counter-n-of-3|$vars.n1 -match '^\d/3$'
key:enter
ms:500
set:n2|UiaName '^\d+/\d+$'
key:enter
ms:500
set:n3|UiaName '^\d+/\d+$'
expect:C1.enter-advances|$vars.n2 -match '^[1-3]/3$' -and $vars.n3 -match '^[1-3]/3$' -and $vars.n2 -ne $vars.n3
key:esc
ms:700
nouia:C1.esc-closes|查找@Edit
shot:closed
